#!args --verify-dirty
# the wheel in the terminal (ui/term.rs): a notch scrolls the system's lines (three in a
# headless run, five with jfgui_WHEEL_LINES 5); the fine steps of a precision touchpad add up to
# whole rows -- six steps of 20 are a notch (each was cut off to no row: it never scrolled)
size 760 520
click tab:"Shell"
click "Flut (10 000 Zeilen)"
expect text:"Zeilen: 10001" exists
key pgup
# rows 09953 .. 09977 in view
expect text:"Flutzeile 09953 #################################" exists
expect text:"Flutzeile 09952 ################################" missing
expect text:"Flutzeile 09977 #################" exists
wheel #1100 20 fine
wheel #1100 20 fine
wheel #1100 20 fine
expect text:"Flutzeile 09952 ################################" exists
expect text:"Flutzeile 09951 ###############################" missing
wheel #1100 20 fine
wheel #1100 20 fine
wheel #1100 20 fine
expect text:"Flutzeile 09950 ##############################" exists
expect text:"Flutzeile 09949 #############################" missing
expect text:"Flutzeile 09975 ###############" missing
system env jfgui_WHEEL_LINES 5
system settings other
wheel #1100 120
expect text:"Flutzeile 09945 #########################" exists
expect text:"Flutzeile 09944 ########################" missing
system env jfgui_WHEEL_LINES -
system settings other
